Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 15:04:13 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] gmmlib: build on macOS as on Linux

macOS user mode is the Linux user mode for gmmlib: the same pthread locks,
GCC atomics, page-table callbacks and syslog logging. Every __linux__ gate
in the library (not the ULTs, not the internal-only assert tracer, not
spdlog's CLOCK_REALTIME_COARSE) also takes __APPLE__.
---
 Source/GmmLib/CachePolicy/GmmGen8CachePolicy.h              | 2 +-
 Source/GmmLib/GlobalInfo/GmmInfo.cpp                        | 4 ++--
 Source/GmmLib/Resource/Linux/GmmResourceInfoLinCWrapper.cpp | 2 +-
 Source/GmmLib/Texture/GmmTextureAlloc.cpp                   | 2 +-
 Source/GmmLib/TranslationTable/GmmPageTableMgr.cpp          | 6 +++---
