 Source/GmmLib/inc/External/Common/GmmPageTableMgr.h         | 6 +++---
 Source/GmmLib/inc/External/Common/GmmResourceInfoExt.h      | 2 +-
 Source/GmmLib/inc/External/Linux/GmmResourceInfoLinExt.h    | 2 +-
 Source/GmmLib/inc/Internal/Linux/GmmResourceInfoLinInt.h    | 2 +-
 Source/util/gfxDebug.h                                      | 2 +-
 15 files changed, 22 insertions(+), 22 deletions(-)

